    {
      "id": "5276",
      "name": "West Coast Combat Robotic League January Event",
      "url": "https://www.robotcombatevents.com/events/5276",
      "start_date": "01/10/2026",
      "end_date": "01/10/2026",
      "location": "Valley Springs, CA, United States",
      "bots_count": 12,
      "logo_url": "https://robotcombatevents.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/event/logo/5276/Logo1.jpg",
      "description": "Welcome to WCCRL! \n\nCheck out this event highlight video from our first event! (Progressive changes have been made since this video was made, such as steel arenas)  \n\n \n\n\n\n***for this event, doors will open at 7am and we will be starting at 9am, saftey must be completed by 8:50 as fights will start promptly at 9am***\n\n\nBetween events we are always improving and upgrading the facility! Every event you will see something new!\n\n\nGENERAL ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nWe are pleased to announce we now have rental bots! So far we have 1 model. It is a well known bot called forceknight. With the creators permission we have added this plastic antweight for rent. If you do not yet have a bot of you're own, but don't want to show up to an event empty handed... we have you covered! \n\n  When you rent a bot you are given a full arena ready bot.  If it is destroyed or damaged, you will be handed another fully ready bot. Double elimination rules apply for rental bots.  If you lose twice, you are out of the competition. But we encourage you to stick around and watch.\n\n     To rent a bot, use the email link below and fill out the form in the body.  We will add you to the list on here. It will appear as ForceKnight RENTAL + (you're initials) \n\nEMAIL: westcoastcombatroboticleague@gmail.com\n\nRental price is $40 for an all day rental. This is to be booked and paid at least 2 weeks in advance. Venmo QR code will be sent in email once booking is made. Venmo is the only accepted form of payment.  This is a non refundable purchase, so please make sure you can make it on that day. Thank you.\n\n\nWe have added a full machining room to the venue! 12 Speed 6ft tall drill press, 20 ton shop press, brake press, spindle grinder, belt sander.   Use whatever machines you need! More machinces will be added over time.\n\n\nThis building is only used for combat robotics. It is fully insulated and air conditioned! We also offer a newly remodeled bathroom located inside the same space. Rain or shine its nice inside!\n\n A table, chair and 6 port power strip is provided per driver. Tables are not plastic tables, they are custom wood tables with great lighting, shelves and a surface you can beat your bot back into shape on! \n\n\nARENA INFO:\n\nBoth arenas are 4ft x 4ft x 2ft tall with air evacuation systems. \n\n They have steel floors and kickplates.\n\n\nGENERAL INFO:\n\nIce cold water bottles and sodas are provided for free! Help yourself!\n\nA lunch time will be alotted. (Either 30 mins or 1 hour long, a concensus will be taken amongst competitors)\n\nRegistrations will close the night before the event, at 6PM(This gives me time to create the voices for bots who sign up late)\n\n\nRULESET:\n\nSPARC ruleset will be followed.\n\nMODIFIED double elimination.\n\nWe will be running both arenas simultaniously. \n\n\nPRICING:\n\nCombat Ant fee is $20\n\nPlastic Ant fee is $20\n\n150G Fairy Weight: $10\n\nThis event will be streamed by us on our YOUTUBE channel. Links Below.\n\nCash or venmo accepted. Yes we can make change. \n\n\nEVENT SCHEDULE:\n\nGates/doors open at 7am.\n\nSaftey/weigh ins start as soon as you are ready.\n\nFights start promptly at 9am.\n\nNo public spectators are permitted as this is a private event. Competitors and your teamates only please.\n\n\nFIRE SAFTEY: \n\nWe have fire extinguishers on site. \n\nSand buckets for lipo breaches.\n\nSingle pass air evacuation for each arena.\n\nBuilding has its own air evacuation system. \n\nIn the event of a building fire the large rollup doors are the emergency exits. They are unlocked at all times on event day, just lift and exit in a calm safe manner. \n\n\nCheck out our instagram for pics and videos of previous events, chat with us on discord for information or discuss venue or bot ideas!\n\nYoutube: www.youtube.com/@WCCRL\n\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/westcoastcombatroboticleague/\n\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/eu36kD6j76\n\n\nWe are making a website that will have alot more information, images and videos. Relase date TBD.",
      "competitions": [
