      "description": "GSCRL Presents: Mechanical Mayhem - MLK Weekend\n\nEvent Details\n\n\n\tOrganizer: Rick Anderson (contact via email or Discord)\n\tDate: Saturday, January 17th, 2026\n\tLocation: 1510B Jersey Ave, North Brunswick, NJ 08902\n\tWebsite: https://gscrl.org\n\n\tRegistration Period: December 1, 2025 - January 16, 2026\n\tArena: More Details to come\n\n\nCategories \u0026 Competition Details\n\n\n\tPlastic Antweight  (16 bots)\n\tStandard Antweight  (16 bots)\n\tFairy Weight  (8 bots) Maybe, 16.\n\n\nSchedule\n\n\n\t8:00 AM: Doors open\n\t9:00 - 10:30 AM: Safety checks and registration\n\t10:00 AM: Drivers, judges, and volunteers meeting\n\t10:30 AM: Competition starts\n\t5:00 - 6:00 PM: Event conclusion and awards\n\n\nWebcast \u0026 Brackets\n\n\n\tYouTube stream: https://youtube.com/@gscrl\n\n\tTrue Finals format for all categories\n\n\nAttendance \u0026 Registration\n\n\n\tDo not attend if experiencing COVID symptoms\n\tFood: There is a Wawa down the road, less than a 5-minute drive.\n\n\nSponsors, please support our sponsors (More To Be Added):\n\n\n\tFUBAR Labs: https://fubarlabs.org/",
