      "description": "RoboClash Tournament @ Robot Renegades Kickoff 2026\n\nThis is a single day event in collaboration with Palm Beach Bots! Our goal is to provide a supportive, beginner-friendly, and low-damage option for young builders. These shorter, fast-paced tournaments are open only to competitors with Camp Witch Doctor or RoboClash robots. This is a great chance to get some competition experience in front of an audience! You'll also get a chance to watch the Robot Renegades full-combat battles. \n\nDon't have a robot yet, but want to compete? There's still time to build your own robot at home! Our robot kits are on sale for a limited time at: https://roboclashkits.com/products/kits\n\n\n\t\nTournament Details\n\n\t\n\t\tWe will be running the tournament in the Camp Witch Doctor Battle Arena with Knock Out Zones\n\t\tTournament format will be either Round Robin or Double Elimination, depending on the number of robots registered\n\t\n\t\n\t\nSchedule\n\t\n\t\tSafety/Set Up: 10AM-10:30AM\n\t\tBuilder's meeting at 10:30AM\n\t\tBattles start at 11AM. We'll be done by 5PM\n\t\n\t\n\t\nRules:\n\t\n\t\tMust compete with a Camp Witch Doctor or RoboClash Robot Kit\n\t\tRobot's internal components (such as motors, escs, battery, servo) must not be upgraded. No Lipo batteries allowed.\n\t\tModifications to the 3D printed parts are permitted.\n\t\tTwo batteries must be fully charged when you arrive.\n\t\n\t\n\n\n Please reach out to andrea@teamwitchdoctor.com with any questions. We'll send additional details via email prior to the event date. We'll see you there!",
