    {
      "id": "6264",
      "name": "Dollar Hobbyz Combat Robot Club Jan. 2026",
      "url": "https://www.robotcombatevents.com/events/6264",
      "start_date": "01/25/2026",
      "end_date": "01/25/2026",
      "location": "Woodbury, MN, United States",
      "bots_count": 8,
      "logo_url": "https://robotcombatevents.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/event/logo/6264/dollar_hobbyz_logo.png",
      "description": "Come join us on Sunday Jan. 25th at 1:00 PM for a fun day of robot fighting! If you're new, you'll be able to find us in the pit area at Dollar Hobbyz. It's up the stairs to the right of the racetrack\n\nAs always, the plan is to do some un-structured robot fighting, driving practice, and just have fun. We will be using the 4'x4' arena with a floor pit provided by Team Scrapper. Experienced builders, new builders, and spectators are all welcome. There will be plenty of roboteers there who are happy to help get new people involved.\n\nWe will be collecting club dues. These will need to be paid by those who intend on using the arena. Anyone can still feel free to show up, ask questions, and spectate for free. Dues will be $25 per year for individuals over the age of 16, or per family. This will gain you access to use the arena at six meetings this year (one every two months or so). They will be collected at the meeting via cash or Venmo.\n\nOther notes:\n\nIf you already have a robot, please register it here, just to help keep track of how many will be attending.\n\nIf you are looking to build your first robot, check out the resources here: https://midwestrobotcombat.com/resources/\n\nIf you have any questions at all, contact Eric Lussky at ELussky@gmail.com\n\nAnd, finally, a special thank you to Dollar Hobbyz for allowing us to use their space",
      "competitions": [
        {
