    {
      "id": "6528",
      "name": "Robot Riot: Ten Terrible Years",
      "url": "https://www.robotcombatevents.com/events/6528",
      "start_date": "01/31/2026",
      "end_date": "01/31/2026",
      "location": "Chicago, IL, United States",
      "bots_count": 0,
      "logo_url": "https://robotcombatevents.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/event/logo/6528/Robot_Riot_10_Terrible_Years_Web.jpg",
      "description": "Robot Riot is turning 10 years old! We've survived the shooting of a gorilla, COVID, at least one recession, and so much else. To celebrate we're breaking in Logan Arcade and throwing an all star event. \n\nRobot Riot is Chicago's worst and only robot fighting league. Our format is Hebocon-style where robots fight Wrestlemania-style in an open air arena. Think glitter cannons and squeaky hammers more than saw blades and flamethrowers. Winners are decided by either KO's, ringouts, or by winning a crowd vote at the end of a match! Bring your bots, win the hearts of the crowd, attain glory. \n\nFor a taste of what our events and robots are like, feel free to check out our Youtube page: https://youtu.be/1qKuSlWW1Wg?si=njGCCF1AFR9Uarm_\n\nEmail RobotRiotCompetition@Gmail.com for rulesets. \n\nOur venue is a bar and requires all participants and audience members to be 21+",
      "competitions": [
        {
          "id": "7159",
          "name": "Main Tournament",
