    {
      "id": "6499",
      "name": "WPI Mixed Open",
      "url": "https://www.robotcombatevents.com/events/6499",
      "start_date": "02/15/2026",
      "end_date": "02/15/2026",
      "location": "Worcester, MA, United States",
      "bots_count": 52,
      "logo_url": "https://robotcombatevents.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/event/logo/6499/WPI_logo3.jpg",
      "description": "WPI is hosting our inaugural Open event! \n\n \n\nWeight Classes:\n\n\n\tBeetleweight (3lb)\n\tPlastic Antweight (1lb)\n\n\nRegistration Fees: $25 per beetle, $10 per PLAnt\n\nRegistration Limits:\n\n\n\t32 Beetleweights\n\t\n\t\t8 Spots are Reserved for WPI Club Members\n\t\n\t\n\t32 PLAnts\n\t\n\t\t10 Spots are Reserved for WPI Club Members\n\t\n\t\n\tRemaining Spots are first come first serve\n\n\nPlease limit builder registration to one robot per weight class.\n\nEvent Details:\n\nOrganizers: WPI Combat Robotics Club (gr-combat-robotics-exec@wpi.edu)\n\nEvent Location:\n\n\n\tHarrington Auditorium\n\tWPI’s Address: 100 Institute Rd Worcester, MA 01609\n\tDate: Sunday, February 15th, 2026\n\n\nParking:\n\n\n\tLocation: Park Avenue Garage\n\tAddress: 151 Salisbury St, Worcester, MA 01609\n\tCost: Free\n\n\nArena:\n\n\n\tAntweight: 4’x4’\n\tBeetleweight: 8’x8’\n\tPainted plywood floors\n\n\nSchedule:\n\n\n\t8:00am - Doors Open\n\t8:30am - Safety Begins\n\t9:45am - Drivers Meeting\n\t10:00am - Competition Begins\n\t12:00pm - Lunch Break\n\t1:00pm - Matches Resume\n\t~8:00pm - Finals, Awards, Pack Up \n\n\nWhat to Bring:\n\n\n\tExtension cords and power strips\n\tEye and Ear protection\n\tAny tools and materials you need to fix your robot\n\tYour robots\n\n\nThe event is for all ages. Attendees under 18 must be accompanied by a parent or guardian.\n\nRulesets:\n\nActive weapon required. \n\nThere will be no DUMMY or movement tests - honor system.\n\n\n\tPlants:\n\t\n\t\tCustom Ruleset (Link Below)\n\t\thttps://tinyurl.com/wpiopenplantrules\n\t\tNo TPU allowed for any components\n\t\tWeight Bonuses\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAll NTL: 1.25 lb\n\t\t\tTrue Walker: 1.5 lb\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tPins limited to 10 seconds\n\t\tNHRL 2025 judging criteria\n\t\n\t\n\tBeetles:\n\t\n\t\tNHRL 2025 Open Ruleset\n\t\t\n\t\t\thttps://wiki.nhrl.io/wiki/index.php?title=NHRL_Open_Rules_-_2025\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tWeight Bonuses (NHRL):\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMultibots: 4 lb\n\t\t\tAll NTL: 4.5 lb\n\t\t\tTrue Walkers: 6 lb\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tNo fire or heat based weapons\n\t\n\t\n\n\nTournament Format:\n\n\n\t3 Round Qualifiers:\n\t\n\t\tRandom NHRL Style Qualifiers \n\t\n\t\n\tSingle Elimination Bracket:\n\t\n\t\tRobots with 2 wins automatically advance to Bracket\n\t\tSeeding will be determined randomly",
