    {
      "id": "6597",
      "name": "BotRumble February 2026",
      "url": "https://www.robotcombatevents.com/events/6597",
      "start_date": "02/15/2026",
      "end_date": "02/15/2026",
      "location": "Westminster, CO, United States",
      "bots_count": 1,
      "logo_url": "https://robotcombatevents.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/event/logo/6597/RCE_Logo__New_-_Square_.png",
      "description": "When: February 15th 2026 from 11:00pm-6:00pm\n\nWhere: HobbyTown Westminster (9120 Wadsworth Pkwy Unit A, Westminster, CO 80021, USA)\n\n🛠️ Weight Classes\n\n\n\t\n\t150g Fairyweights\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tControl\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tCombat\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t1lb Plastic Antweights (must follow SPARC 16.3 Plastic Class Rule)\n\t\n\n\n💵 Registration\n\n\n\t\n\tSuggested donation - $5 per class \n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tFirst time drivers and competitors under 16 are free\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tPrepay at PayPal here or bring cash/check \n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n📆 Event Schedule\n\n\n\t\n\tSetup Begins: Around 10:45am\n\t\n\t\n\tCheck-in and Safety : 11:00am\n\t\n\t\n\tMatches Begin: 11:15am\n\t\n\n\n🏟️ Arena\n\n\n\t\nFairy and Ant\n\n\t\n\t\t6' x 6' x 4' \n\t\t2 layers of 1/4\" polycarbonate and a 1/8\" polycarbonate kick plate\n\t\tWood floor painted with anti-slip paint (https://www.behr.com/consumer/products/floor-coatings-sealers-and-prep/porch-and-patio-floor-paints/porch-patio-anti-slip-floor-paint)\n\t\tNo hazards or pits\n\t\n\t\n\n\n🏁 Tournament Format\n\n\n\tFairies - Single Elimination \n\tPlastic Antweight - Depends on number of bots registered\n\n\n🎁 Prizes\n\nSponsored by Overture Filament \n\n🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Spectators\n\nWe love spectators! Bring your friends, family, and anyone curious about robot fighting.  Spectating is always free.\n\n📢 Contact\n\nFor more information or questions please join our Discord at https://discord.botrumble.com or find us on Facebook",
