    {
      "id": "6369",
      "name": "Robot Conflict at Motorama 2026",
      "url": "https://www.robotcombatevents.com/events/6369",
      "start_date": "02/20/2026",
      "end_date": "02/22/2026",
      "location": "Harrisburg, PA, United States",
      "bots_count": 1,
      "logo_url": "https://robotcombatevents.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/event/logo/6369/images.jfif",
      "description": "MOTORAMA - ROBOT CONFLICT \n\nFebruary 20-22, 2026\n\nFriday 11AM - 5PM - Fairy and Ant Tournament (held during Motorama set-up day)\n\nSaturday  9AM to 10PM  -Beetles, 12 lb Sportsman, 30 lb Sportsman (Two-Day Tournament) \nSunday 9AM to 5PM  \n\nRobot Conflict is back again this year ready to smash, bash and trash those winter blues you may be having.  Warm up to the heated double elimination competition as 5 different weight classes compete until there can be only one victor.  Who will take the titles this year?  Find out by braving the Polar Vortex and come out to the Motorama show in Harrisburg, PA.  Witness one of the largest combat robotics competitions on the East Coast. See bots of all shapes and sizes square off as each try to fight their way to the top.   \n\nREGISTRATION WILL OPEN ON NOVEMBER 1 AT 7:00PM EST\n\nRegistation is handled by Motorama Events. \n\n \n\nCompetitor registration costs $65.00 for the first weight class and $45.00 for each additional weight class entered.  Your registration Includes one weekend pass for the competitor, your pit space and electric.  \n\nFor more information pleae visit: https://www.facebook.com/groups/NorthEastRoboticsClub/ \n\nIf you don't do Facebook, or just want a different way to contact someone from NERC, you can email Buffy Elliott at elliottbuffy@gmail.com.  \n\n \n\nFacility Parking Details\n\nWe suggest you purchase an advanced participant parking pass which gains you quick access into the venue's general parking lots for single space vehicle parking. Be sure to display your parking pass when arriving Saturday and Sunday so staff knows you are a prepaid participant.  If you bring more than a single vehicle, you must purchase an off-site Elmerton Lot or Reserved Lot space when registering.  Please note that after 8:30am there is no guaranteed access to the on-site lot due to the large volume of traffic,  you may be directed to an alternate lot and bussed over.\n\nIf you will be bringing additional pit crew with you, please purchase their ticket(s) when you register so they receive participant passes to get into the show at 8:00am with you.  All general admission passes are for 9:00am entry.  \n\nImportant Event Information: After completion of your entry, go back to the registration page for participant information, download and print maps and lodging information before coming to Harrisburg. It could make your Motorama visit less stressful. \n\nPlease direct all general event questions to the Motorama Events main office at 717-359-7056 or info@motoramaevents.com",
      "competitions": [
        {
