      "start_date": "02/21/2026",
      "end_date": "02/21/2026",
      "location": "Salt Lake City, UT, United States",
      "bots_count": 15,
      "logo_url": "https://robotcombatevents.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/event/logo/6500/ucrlogo.jpg",
      "description": "🛠️ Weight Classes:\n\n\n\t\n\t150g Fairyweights\n\t\n\t\n\t1lb Plastic Antweights (SPARC 16.3 Plastic Class Rules)\n\t\n\t\n\t1lb Full Combat Antweights\n\t\n\t\n\t3lb Beetleweights\n\t\n\n\n\n💵 Registration:\n\n\n\t\n\t$25 per bot – Register and pay on RobotCombatEvents.com\n\t\n\t\n\tAll bots must be pre-registered\n\t\n\t\n\tPlastic class bots must meet SPARC v1.5 Construction Specifications\n\t\n\n\n⚠️ Note: Space is limited! Unlike past events, opening beyond 16 bots per class is unlikely. Please register only one bot per driver per class until closer to the event to give everyone a chance to compete.\n\n\n📆 Event Schedule:\n\n\n\t\n\tSetup: Friday (noon– 7 PM) and Saturday (7:00 AM)\n\t\n\t\n\tMatches Begin: Before 9:30 AM Saturday\n\t\n\t\n\tFinals Start: Around 7:00 PM Saturday\n\t\n\n\n\n🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Spectators:\n\n🎟️ Free Admission! Bring your friends, family, and anyone who loves a little carnage for the holidays. No tickets required — just show up and enjoy the robot-fueled destruction.\n\n\n🏟️ Arenas \u0026 Hazards:\n\nWe’re running three arenas to keep the fights moving:\n\n🔹 8' Beetleweight Arena (Wood Floor)\n\n\n\t\n\tDrop pit activates in the final 60 seconds\n\t\n\n\n🔹 4' Fairyweight Arena (Wood Floor)\n\n\n\t\n\tHome of the Toblerones of Doom\n\t\n\t\n\tFinal 60 seconds: Toblerones become pits — get stuck for 10 seconds and you’re done\n\t\n\n\n🔹 Plastic \u0026 Full Combat Arenas\n\n\n\t\n\t6 ft hex arena\n\t\n\t\n\tClean, standard layouts with no corner hazards\n\t\n\n\n\n🏁 Tournament Format:\n\n\n\t\n\tDouble-Elimination Bracket\n\t\n\t\n\tOne-and-Done Final Round\n\t\n\t\n\tStrict 20-Minute Rebuild Timer — miss your call and you forfeit\n\t\n\t\n\tClasses with 6 or fewer bots will run Round Robin format\n\t\n\n\n\n⚖️ Judging Criteria (11 Points):\n\n\n\t\n\tDamage (5 pts): Real, lasting damage (not just scratches)\n\t\n\t\n\tControl (3 pts): Arena dominance and positioning\n\t\n\t\n\tAggression (3 pts): Who hunted the fight vs. who ran\n\t\n\n\n\n⚙️ UCR Special Rules:\n\nGrip Additives \u0026 Entanglement\n\n\n\t\n\tLatex, rubber, silicone allowed\n\t\n\t\n\tEntanglement = disqualification\n\t\n\t\n\tIncidental part loss doesn’t count unless intentional\n\t\n\n\nUnsticks \u0026 Wall Slamming\n\n\n\t\n\tUnsticks only if robots are fused together 3 times\n\t\n\t\n\t1 unstick from arena each bot.\n\t\n\t\n\t10 seconds to move or KO\n\t\n\t\n\tSlamming the arena to escape = automatic loss\n\t\n\n\n\n📢 Contact:\n\nFor questions, registration issues, or sponsorship: 📧 utahcombatrobots@gmail.com 📞 801-372-3817\n\n\n🎥 Live Stream:\n\nBrought to you by The Synshop: 👉 twitch.tv/synshop 👉 youtube.com/synshop\n\n\n💥 Whether you’re a battle-hardened veteran or stepping into the box for the first time, Presidential Carnage is your chance to unleash the beast. Get registered, get building, and join us for a holiday brawl like no other!\n\n🩸 Sponsors: oshcut.com |",
