    {
      "id": "6032",
      "name": "Sacramento Bot Battles 2026 - 15lb  CA Championships!",
      "url": "https://www.robotcombatevents.com/events/6032",
      "start_date": "03/20/2026",
      "end_date": "03/21/2026",
      "location": "Rocklin, CA, United States",
      "bots_count": 18,
      "logo_url": "https://robotcombatevents.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/event/logo/6032/SBB.png",
      "description": "High School \u0026 College Teams…..Come Battle it Out for the California 15lb Combat Robotics Championships at the NRL California event!\n \n\n2026 will also include Impact Robotics League Event #3\n1lb plastic ant competition open to middle school and high school builders\n\nEvent is open to the Public and Free for Spectators!\n\nCome see Sparks Fly and Metal Crunch as Robots Go to Battle! \nHeld at Sierra College in Rocklin, CA\nCampus Center Cafeteria\n \n\nEvent Classes:\n\n\n\t15lb BotsIQ (HS/College age teams only) - registration open now\n\tImpact Robotics League Plastic Ants\n\t\n\tPlease see the details for each Bot Class.  Make sure to contact the event organizer to confirm details.  \n\n\nSchedule To Be Released in the Futurem but will include\n- Friday evening Safety/Inspection-\n- Saturday Doors open to teams at 7:30\n- Saturday Doors open to Public at 8:30.\n- Fights begin ~9:00AM\n\nPlastic Ant Rule Set \n\n\n\tImpact Robotics League Ruleset and Divisions \n\n\ncontact:  events@PlacerRobotics.org",
