    {
      "id": "6593",
      "name": "Harbor City Robot Riot",
      "url": "https://www.robotcombatevents.com/events/6593",
      "start_date": "03/21/2026",
      "end_date": "03/21/2026",
      "location": "Duluth, MN, United States",
      "bots_count": 0,
      "logo_url": "https://www.robotcombatevents.com/assets/RCELogo-3383ca77f76e5be2b7755ea9d0c464aea25a87d8c9f2a4cffd63643392f59fe7.png",
      "description": "The Harbor City Robot Riot will be hosting our 3rd annual event in Duluth, MN. We will have beetleweight, antweight, and plastic antweight classes. We will also be a qualifying event.\n\nOur tournament will be held at the DECC in downtown Duluth, MN during the Motorhead Madness Car Show on Saturday, March 21, 2026 from 8am until we finish in the afternoon. Inspections will be from 8-10 am with the tournament starting at 10am. Each robot will receive up to 2 tickets to enter the Motorhead Madness Car Show and access the event. Additonal tickets can be purchased at the front door. \n\nIt will be a modified swiss bracket.\n\nThe cage is 8' by 8' with a wood floor and ceiling and Lexan walls with two layers, 1/4\" inner and 1/8\" outer with an 1\" airspace. \n\nMRCA ruleset will be used.\n\nPlease only enter one robot per class per driver. If there are additional openings, they may be added the day of the event on site.",
      "competitions": [
        {
