    {
      "id": "6477",
      "name": "Nexus Knockout 3",
      "url": "https://www.robotcombatevents.com/events/6477",
      "start_date": "04/04/2026",
      "end_date": "04/04/2026",
      "location": "Sunnyvale, CA, United States",
      "bots_count": 48,
      "logo_url": "https://robotcombatevents.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/event/logo/6477/NexusKnockoutWStroke.png",
      "description": "🔥 Nexus Knockout 3 – Combat Robotics Event 🔥\n📅 April 4th, 2026 | 🕘 9:00 AM – 5:00 PM\n📍 Maker’s Nexus – 1330 Orleans Dr, Sunnyvale, CA 94089\n\nGet ready for another action-packed day at Nexus Knockout 3! Join builders, fans, and teams for a full day of combat robotics featuring:\n\n\n\t\n\t150G Fairyweight\n\t\n\t\n\tPlant Class Bots\n\t\n\t\n\t3lb Beetleweights\n\t\n\t\n\tBot Hockey Matches\n\t\n\n\nWhether you’re competing or spectating, it’s going to be an unforgettable day of sparks, strategy, and community.\n\n\n📝 Registration\n\n\n\n\t\n\t$20 per team for 150g, Plant, and 3lb classes\n\t\n\t\n\t$50 per team for Bot Hockey\n\tRegistration fees help cover table/chair rentals and arena trailer logistics.\n\t\n\n\nPrizes: TBD\n\n\n🛠️ Schedule\n\n\n\n\t\n\t8:00 AM – Pits open\n\t\n\t\n\t8:30 AM – Safety check-in\n\t\n\t\n\t9:00 AM – Estimated event start (please be flexible—there’s always a lot to set up!)\n\t\n\n\n\n🔋 Battery Policy\n\n\n\n\t\n\tAll 3lb and Bot Hockey batteries MUST be charged outdoors.\n\t\n\t\n\tAbsolutely NO unmonitored charging for any weight class.\n\t\n\n\nSafety is top priority—thank you for helping keep the event safe and smooth.\n\n\n🍪 Food \u0026 Refreshments\n\n\nSnacks and drinks will be provided for all teams and attendees!\n\n\nCome hang out with fellow builders, show off your robot, and enjoy an awesome day of combat robotics. We can’t wait to see you at Nexus Knockout 3!",
