    {
      "id": "6335",
      "name": "Motown Bot Showdown 4 at i3Detroit",
      "url": "https://www.robotcombatevents.com/events/6335",
      "start_date": "04/11/2026",
      "end_date": "04/11/2026",
      "location": "Ferndale, MI, United States",
      "bots_count": 0,
      "logo_url": "https://robotcombatevents.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/event/logo/6335/800px-Logo_large_png8__1_.png",
      "description": "Registration opens September 12 at 6pm EST.  \n\nThis is a MRCA ranked event\n\nDate: April 11, 2026\n\nLocation: i3Detroit\n\nVenue: i3Detroit is the largest non-profit maker space in the Metro Detroit area, located in Ferndale, MI, just north of Detroit.  i3Detroit\n\nParking: Parking in front of the venue is limited, please see Parking - i3Detroit for more details on where you can park\n\nFood:  TBD\n\nArena: 8’ x 8’, wood floor\n\nRough Schedule:\n\n\n\t\n\t8:00am – Doors Open for Competitors\n\t\n\t\n\t8:30am - Safety Opens\n\t\n\t\n\t9:00am – Doors Open for Spectators\n\t\n\t\n\t10:00am – Matches start\n\t\n\n\nEntry Fee: $20 per bot\n\nRuleset: This event will follow MRCA rules\n\nSpectators: Spectators are welcome and free to attend and doors open at 9am.\n\nThe event will be livestreamed at the i3 Detroit YouTube channel",
