    {
      "id": "6429",
      "name": "SmashBotz Presents: Neotropolis Battle in the Future!",
      "url": "https://www.robotcombatevents.com/events/6429",
      "start_date": "05/02/2026",
      "end_date": "05/02/2026",
      "location": "Edwards Air Force Base, CA, United States",
      "bots_count": 5,
      "logo_url": "https://robotcombatevents.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/event/logo/6429/sdsdsdsdsdsdsd.jpg",
      "description": "It's that time again to step into the future! SmashBotz is back to host yet another amazing robot battle at the Cyber/Sci-Fi Festival Neotropolis! What better place to hold a robot competition, right?! We plan to run the 1 pound plastic ant class on Saturday evening for as there is the most action at the event during this time. We will have a designated pit area right in the middle of all the action! This will be a cyberpunk/Sci-fi immersive event so feel free to get creative with your botz as well as yourself. There will be no registration fees for this event. Please refer to \"sparc\" rules and guidelines. Please keep in mind that this is an 18+ event. There is hotel/motel options near the event if you are not the camping type.  I'm currently working with the promoters on getting discount/compted tickets so the first builders to sign up get first dibs! Let's show these cyber-nerds what REAL robot combat is about! \n\n   There will be more specific information about this event as it becomes available. For now please feel free to visit the event site for more information about safety and specifics of the event:  https://www.neotropolis.com/home  \n\nhttps://youtu.be/skRYKMoH_oA?si=dbFXg2qJtLp9kBP3\n\nNOTE: There is an admission fee to attend the NEOTROPOLIS event.\n\nFor more information please email at:SmashBotz@protonmail.com\n\n*Please refer to http://sparc.tools/ for rules and guidelines.   (One unstick rule)",
